# The apps in Patrone's app index, one per line:
#   GitHub project              app ID                               release file prefix
# Each project's latest release must carry <prefix>-<version>-linux-x86_64.tar.gz
# (the app, downloaded at install time) and <prefix>-<version>-linux-x86_64.flatpak
# (read once, for the app's listing and permissions).
storytold/photocraft            ai.storyteller.photocraft            photocraft
storytold/pdfcraft              ai.storyteller.pdfcraft              pdfcraft
storytold/filmcraft             ai.storyteller.filmcraft             filmcraft
storytold/wordcraft             ai.storyteller.wordcraft             wordcraft
storytold/lightcraft            ai.storyteller.lightcraft            lightcraft
storytold/vectorcraft           ai.storyteller.vectorcraft           vectorcraft
storytold/effectcraft           ai.storyteller.effectcraft           effectcraft
storytold/cadcraft              ai.storyteller.cadcraft              cadcraft
storytold/gridcraft             ai.storyteller.gridcraft             gridcraft
storytold/designcraft           ai.storyteller.designcraft           designcraft
storytold/deckcraft             ai.storyteller.deckcraft             deckcraft
storytold/soundcraft            ai.storyteller.soundcraft            soundcraft
storytold/figcraft              ai.storyteller.figcraft              figcraft
UCS-Care-Group/mailcraft        io.github.billsecond.mailcraft       mailcraft
# Not storytold/craft-launcher (ArtCraft Launcher): its icon is the ArtCraft
# Team's trademarked "A", which their NOTICE keeps out of the open-source
# licence. Back when they allow it.
